  "name": "pnge",
  "version": "0.9.0",
  "description": "Petroleum and chemical engineering skills for WVU PNGE undergraduates. 76 skills, 12 agents, 12 commands. Covers Li/Mg recovery from produced waters, state regulatory data (TX RRC, NM OCD, ND DMR, LA SONRIS, AR AOGC, OK OCC, CA CalGEM, CO ECMC, Appalachian mineral parcels), federal data (EIA, USGS, NETL, EPA regulatory stack, BOEM, BLM, NASA, BLS, BEA, Census, EJScreen/CEJST/SVI), unified literature search (OpenAlex + CrossRef + USGS Pubs + OSTI) with DataCite dataset DOIs, DLE patent landscape, techno-economic analysis, PHREEQC geochemistry, water chemistry QA/QC, lab method planning, research synthesis, well completions, production engineering, petrophysics, and engineering science tutoring.",
